      },
      "message": "fix(post): assign stable tool numbers on add, import, and project load\n\nAssign the lowest unused controller tool number in 1-99999 at tool\ncreation (`AddTool`, `ImportTools`) instead of falling back to the\ntool's alphabetical list rank. Freeze unnumbered tools in legacy project\nfiles to their 1-based name-sorted rank during load, and refuse clearing\na tool's number back to `None`.\n\nFixes #2442",
